{"id":"9ed8e054bd690153","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange.md","title":"Moving Number Quantifiers past Real Quantifiers","display":"thm-real-quantifier-interchange — Moving Number Quantifiers past Real Quantifiers","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange","aliases":["68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange"],"display":"thm-real-quantifier-interchange — Moving Number Quantifiers past Real Quantifiers","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-real-sequence-coding]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§19 rules II–III p.72 / PDF 81","verification_status":"source-adapted-and-derived","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-real-quantifier-interchange — Moving Number Quantifiers past Real Quantifiers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f262e3cfb0b8ba42\" href=\"?note=f262e3cfb0b8ba42\" title=\"68-df-real-sequence-coding\">68-df-real-sequence-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§19 rules II–III p.72 / PDF 81"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-and-derived"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为任意关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{col}\">\\(\\mathrm{col}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f262e3cfb0b8ba42\" href=\"?note=f262e3cfb0b8ba42\" title=\"68-df-real-sequence-coding\">68-df-real-sequence-coding</a>。Assertion 直接使用关系成员式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;x\\in Q\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\alpha(0)\\in Q\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;x\\in Q\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\alpha(0)\\in Q\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;x\\in Q\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\alpha(0)\\in Q\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;x\\in Q\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\alpha(0)\\in Q\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\gamma,x),x)\\in P\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\gamma,x),x)\\in P\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\gamma,x),x)\\in P\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\gamma,x),x)\\in P\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §19，印刷 p.72 / PDF p.81，规则 II 与 III，已对照页面图像核对六式。前两式使用全体常值实得到 α↦α(0) 的满射性；同类量词交换是逻辑等价。第五式从每个 x 选择一个实见证，按实序列编码合成 γ；本节点明确以 ZFC 承担所用可数选择。最后一式对第五式以 ¬P 作对偶得到。不能把异类量词直接交换而省略列编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-real-sequence-coding","status":"resolved","id":"f262e3cfb0b8ba42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-real-sequence-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$P\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathbb N$、$Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为任意关系。$\\mathcal B$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]，$\\mathrm{col}$ 见 [[68-df-real-sequence-coding]]。Assertion 直接使用关系成员式。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-real-sequence-coding","status":"resolved","id":"f262e3cfb0b8ba42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$P\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathbb N$、$Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为任意关系。$\\mathcal B$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]，$\\mathrm{col}$ 见 [[68-df-real-sequence-coding]]。Assertion 直接使用关系成员式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{col}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;x\\in Q\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\alpha(0)\\in Q\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;x\\in Q\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\alpha(0)\\in Q\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\gamma,x),x)\\in P\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\alpha,x)\\in P\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\gamma,x),x)\\in P\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2420,"backlinks":[{"id":"c701ad2d561329ae","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-real-quantifier-interchange|thm-real-quantifier-interchange — Moving Number Quantifiers past Real Quantifiers]]"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","f262e3cfb0b8ba42"]}